<title>BELGIUM: EU sets monthly sugar production refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sets monthly sugar production refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set monthly production refunds, an EU  official said.</p>
<p>The refunds were fixed as follows-</p>
<p>	  Whites	    41.67 Ecus per 100 kg</p>
<p>	  Raws		37.69 Ecus per 100 kg</p>
<p>	  Syrup	     41.67 Ecus per 100 kg</p>
<p>	  Inulin syrup    79.17 Ecus per 100 kg</p>
<p>&quot;The Committee also set quarterly refunds for chemical products made with sugar and refunds for non-annex II products,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The refunds for chemical products were set at 34.565 Ecus per 100 kg and non-annex two refunds were set at 41.67 Ecus per 100 kg for whites and 38.33 for raws.</p>
</text>
